I suppose the easiest fix for your emample right now is just to allow multiple enviroments to be defined on a per-call basis. So change

CAT1 = mirtCAT(df, mod, design_elements = TRUE)
CAT2 = CAT1

to

CAT1 = mirtCAT(df, mod, design_elements = TRUE)

CAT2 = mirtCAT(df, mod, design_elements = TRUE)

to avoid sharing the same enviroment.

Phil

